  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Cambodia Cooperation for Equitable Sustainable Services Phase 2 (ACCESS 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia-Cambodia Cooperation for Equitable Sustainable Services Phase 2 (ACCESS 2) aims to improve the sustainability of quality, inclusive services for persons with disabilities and those affected by gender-based violence. The program seeks to build on the success and lessons learned from the program&#x2019;s first phase (2018 &#x2013; 2023). ACCESS 2 focuses on ensuring survivors of GBV and people with disabilities are reached with quality and integrated services that respond to their expressed needs. It also supports organisations and groups representing survivors of GBV and people with disabilities to engage in policy and planning processes for GBV and disability services.</narrative>
  </description>
